## Root causes (system conditions)

Each cause was removed in every combination and the shift replayed (exact Shapley values over 4 subsets). *Alone* = recovered by removing only this cause; *last* = what it adds once every other cause is gone.

| # | Condition | Shapley (parcel-min) | Share | Alone | Last | Responsibility | Replays |
